# Place your button screenshots here for image recognition
#
# Required images (place PNG files in this folder):
# =================================================
#
# 1. btn_change_line.png
#    - 主界面的"更换线路"按钮截图
#
# 2. line_aa1_red.png
#    - "美国节点-免费试用AA1" 在红色（不可用）状态下的整行截图
#
# 3. line_aa2_red.png
#    - "美国节点-免费试用AA2" 在红色（不可用）状态下的整行截图
#
# 4. line_aa3_red.png
#    - "美国节点-永久用户AA3" 在红色（不可用）状态下的整行截图
#
# 5. status_connected.png
#    - 连接成功后的"已连接"状态截图
#
# =================================================
# How it works (reverse matching):
# =================================================
# 脚本只保存了红色（不可用）版本的线路截图。
# 当线路变成蓝色/黄色（可用）时，locateOnScreen 就匹配不到红色截图了。
# 匹配不到 = 线路可用 → 直接点击该线路。
#
# =================================================
# How to capture:
# =================================================
# 1. Run: python get_coords.py --snapshot
#    (takes a screenshot of the VPN window)
# 2. Use an image editor to crop each button/line area
# 3. Save as PNG with the filenames listed above
# 4. Run the main script: python main.py
#
# Tips:
#   - Keep images small (just the button/line itself)
#   - Use original resolution (don't scale)
#   - Ensure the image is unique on the screen
#   - For line screenshots, include the full row content
